<title>USA: TABLE - Seagate Technology Inc Q4 results.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Seagate Technology Inc Q4 results.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTTS VALLEY, Calif. 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>SEAGATE TECHNOLOGY, INC.</p>
<p>				   FINANCIAL HIGHLIGHTS</p>
<p>		 (In Thousands Except Per Share and Percent Data)</p>
