<p>NOTE: (1) The three and twelve month periods ended June 28, 1996 have been restated to reflect a two-for-one stock split in the form of a stock dividend in November 1996.</p>
<p>Q4 ended June 27, 1997 includes litigation charges of $153 million. Excluding the charges and their tax effect, Q4 1997 earnings per share would have been $0.61.</p>
<p>Q4 ended June 28, 1996 also includes one-time write-offs and other charges. Excluding these charges and their tax effect, earnings per share would have been $0.52.</p>
<p>Exluding charges for the years ending June 27, 1997 and June 28, 1996, earnings per share would have been $3.05 and $2.06, respectively.</p>
